## Summary
March Jinn is an Azerbaijan-born musical artist, producer, and creative director. Founder of the MIRAGE⁶ collective and label (MIRAGE⁶ Audio). Known for blending Atlanta trap, Memphis rap, psychedelic, and rock soundscapes with provocative audio-visual statements.

